      "title": "Coffee with the President of the Academy",
      "body": "The rector of the college asks you to his rooms after supper, where a monsignor you have never met is drinking his coffee: the president of the Pontifical Ecclesiastical Academy. He has read your professors' reports, he says, and heard you at a reception speak to an ambassador's wife in her own language. When your degree is done, would you come across the city to the Academy instead of going home? Your bishop has been written to, and has said he will not stand in the way, which is not the same as saying yes.",
